ard, category pages, catalyst discovery, alerts console live mode</td><td><a href="data/cors-probe.json">Raw measured headers (committed evidence)</a> · <a href="verification/2026-11-21-c85ee474.md">Verification record + method</a> · <a href="https://fetch.spec.whatwg.org/#http-cors-protocol">WHATWG Fetch: CORS protocol</a> · <a href="https://docs.kalshi.com/getting_started/demo_env">Kalshi: demo environment</a></td><td><span class="badge ok">Resolved</span></td></tr>
