        <tr><td><span id="F-53"></span>F-53</td><td>Method</td><td>The alert engine scores a swing with a fixed published heuristic — weights 0.20 headroom / 0.20 move size / 0.35 liquidity / 0.25 spread, threshold 0.62, samples older than an hour halved — and it is <em>not</em> back-tested. It also does not predict outcomes. Each alert prints its own term values so the ranking can be audited.</td><td>High-ROI alert feed</td><td><a href="docs/ALERTS.md">docs/ALERTS.md §3.4</a> · <a href="alerts/index.html">the console (method section)</a></td><td><span class="badge good">Rule published</span></td></tr>
        <tr><td><span id="F-L4-01"></span>F-L4-01</td><td>Open reconciliation (aggregate volume)</td><td><strong>Rechecked 2026-11-21.</strong> The official demo endpoint <code>GET /series/KXDPWORLDTOUR?include_volume=true</code> returns <code>volume_fp: "8245802181.00"</code>. Kalshi’s <a href="https://docs.kalshi.com/api-reference/market/get-series.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Series</a> schema defines <code>volume_fp</code> as the total contracts traded across all events in the series. A separate <code>GET /markets?series_ticker=KXDPWORLDTOUR&amp;limit=5</code> sample returns five markets, with individual <code>volume_fp</code> values from 104,618.88 to 348,906.19. Five sampled markets are not a complete series census, so this does not reconcile or refute the series total. The earlier claim that the single-series endpoint lacked <code>volume_fp</code> and the list-query “filter bug” explanation were incorrect; see <a href="#F-54">F-54</a>. Full-market reconciliation remains open.</td><td>Golf series volume</td><td><a href="https://external-api.demo.kalshi.co/trade-api/v2/series/KXDPWORLDTOUR?include_volume=true" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Series endpoint with documented <code>include_volume</code></a> · <a href="https://docs.kalshi.com/api-reference/market/get-series.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Series: aggregate-volume definition</a> · <a href="https://external-api.demo.kalshi.co/trade-api/v2/markets?series_ticker=KXDPWORLDTOUR&amp;limit=5" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Five-market sample</a> · <a href="https://docs.kalshi.com/api-reference/market/get-markets.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Get Markets</a></td><td><span class="badge warn">Needs review</span></td></tr>
